        "snippet": "\ud83d\udcca SGLT2 Inhibitors vs. GLP-1 Receptor Agonists for Type 2 Diabetes"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Choosing between an SGLT2 inhibitor and a GLP-1 receptor agonist depends heavily on your specific health history, organ risks, and treatment preferences, as modern guidelines often position both classes alongside or before metformin for high-risk patients.",
